`  $$   WHY CALL IT EARTHBOUND ZERO?                                     $$  '
  qb'                                                                    `qb
,d$b.      I thought of this title because the numbering for this series ,d$b.
$$  '      got a little screwed up when  NOA decided not to release this `  $$
`qb        first game. This game, Mother, was to be known as EarthBound,   qb'
,d$b.      but it didn't  come out.  When they  translated  and released ,d$b.
`  $$      Mother part 2 for the SNES,  they went ahead and decided just $$  '
  qb'      to call that EarthBound,  since we would never know what we'd `qb
,d$b.      missed (until now! hah!). So, the title as it appears in this ,d$b.
$$  '      ROM is EarthBound,  but i prefer to  call it EarthBound Zero, `  $$
`qb        sorta  like Street  Fighter Zero -  it hints of  a prequel by   qb'
,d$b.      nature.                                                       ,d$b.
